+
+| Field              | Type   | Required | Description                                                    |
+| ------------------ | ------ | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`             | string | Yes      | `"list_sessions"`                                              |
+| `limit`            | number | No       | Non-negative integer number of summaries requested             |
